  hintId: tutorial_enhanced_scan
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 0
  title: Enhanced Scan
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 36a9e58a46f0b6f48880ebf33709c385, type: 3}
  description: 'The <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>enhanced_scan</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font>
    command is an improved version of <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>scan</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font>.


    It
    extends its range in front of the robot until it hits a tile that is not a floor.
    This means the robot can detect objects that are further away without needing
    to move step by step.


    Example:

    <indent=1em><font="JetBrainsMono SDF">result
    <color=#D4D4D4>=</color> <font="JetBrainsMono SDF"><color=#33CC66>enhanced_scan</color><color=#D4D4D4>()</color></font></font></indent>


    The
    returned value can be used like a normal scan result to decide what action the
    robot should take next.</indent>'
  isImageBig: 0
